      "content": "peace in giving up... what does that even mean? like, if i just stop trying to fight this, what's the point? everything is just so heavy. i feel like the only way to actually stop the noise and the rejection is to just... not be around anymore. do you think that's a valid way to feel? that maybe leaving is the only way to finally have control over something?",
